.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_smart_infw" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_smart_infw \- Informative Warning
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_smart_infw {
.br
.BI "    NVME_SMART_INFW_VLTHW"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_SMART_INFW_VLTHW" 12
Voltage Log Threshold Warning: if set, then the
Overvoltage Valid (OVV) bit or the Undervoltage
Valid (UVV) bit in the Voltage Measurement log
page is set to '1'.
